
















<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office"
      xmlns:x="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:excel"
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8">
<title>이용대금명세서</title>
<style>
tr{mso-height-source:auto;mso-ruby-visibility:none}
col{mso-width-source:userset;mso-ruby-visibility:none}
br{mso-data-placement:same-cell}
table{font-family: "맑은 고딕", "Malgun Gothic", "굴림", "Gulim", "Arial", sans-serif;font-size:10pt;border-collapse:collapse}
th,td{border:0.5pt solid #808080;text-align:center;color:windowtext;word-break:break-all}
th{background:#d9d9d9}
.x-total th, .x-total td{background:#eee;font-weight:700}
.x-tit1{width:100%;color:windowtext;font-size:20pt;font-weight:700;text-align:center;text-decoration:underline}
.x-tit2{margin-bottom:0;color:windowtext;font-size:12pt;font-weight:700;text-align:left;text-decoration:underline}
.x-right{text-align:right}
.x-left{text-align:left}
.x-space{border:0}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h2 class="x-tit2">■ 요약내역</h2>
<table border="1">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>구분</th><th>이용대금</th><th>결제일</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th rowspan="3">이번달</th><td>123,450원</td><td>2026.03.10</td></tr>
    <tr><td>0원</td><td>2026.04.10</td></tr>
    <tr><td>0원</td><td>2026.05.10</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2 class="x-tit2">■ 상세내역</h2>
<table border="1">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th rowspan="2">이용일</th>
      <th rowspan="2">가맹점명</th>
      <th rowspan="2">이용총액</th>
      <th colspan="2">이번 달 입금하실 금액</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <th>원금</th>
      <th>수수료</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>2026.03.11</td><td class="x-left">샘플가맹점</td><td class="x-right">123,450원</td><td class="x-right">123,450원</td><td class="x-right">0원</td></tr>
    <tr><td>2026.03.12</td><td class="x-left">테스트마트</td><td class="x-right">7,800원</td><td class="x-right">7,800원</td><td class="x-right">0원</td></tr>
    <tr class="x-total"><th colspan="2">합계</th><td class="x-right">131,250원</td><td class="x-right">131,250원</td><td class="x-right">0원</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>통신요금은 별도 청구되며 아래 표는 이월된 금액만 표시합니다. 이 안내문은 표 바로 앞에
오지만 제목이 아니므로 시트 이름이 되어서는 안 됩니다.</p>
<h2 class="x-tit2">■ 통신요금 이월내역</h2>
<table border="1">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>항목</th><th>금액</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>이월 통신요금</td><td>0원</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2 class="x-tit2">■ 해외이용금액 상세내역</h2>
<table border="1">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>이용일자</th><th>가맹점</th><th>이용금액</th><th>청구금액</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>2026.03.14</td><td>SAMPLE SHOP</td><td>10,000</td><td>10,000</td></tr>
    <tr><td>2026.03.15</td><td>EXAMPLE STORE</td><td>98,760</td><td>98,760</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

</body>
</html>
